    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37083" root="كفت" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرَسٌ كُفَتٌ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُفَتَةٌ</span>, <i>A horse that leaps,
springs,</i> or <i>bounds, with his whole body and limbs,
and so that one cannot get possession of him,</i> or
<i>obtain the mastery over him.</i> (K.) See also art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كلت</span>.

